		},
		{
			"id":"dfdc12f047b8f279",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"考公记录 UP",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":165,
			"y":-60,
			"width":130,
			"height":60,
			"color":"1"
		},
		{
			"id":"72a49a9c151d449b",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"江苏省考",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":180,
			"y":-160,
			"width":100,
			"height":60
		},
		{
			"id":"dabe82ed3638706a",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"2025 年高校毕业生 1222 万，未来 15 年每年都超过 1600 万。\n\n形势只会越来越严峻。\n\n考公必须提早！",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":380,
			"y":-180,
			"width":435,
			"height":160
		},
		{
			"id":"c245eaa0728cbe0f",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"[[考公指南.canvas|考公指南]]",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":380,
			"y":20,
			"width":180,
			"height":120
		},
		{
			"id":"98c4a44eb94af762",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"English",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":-382,
			"y":20,
			"width":105,
			"height":60,
			"color":"1"
		},
		{
			"id":"83425fd5506b37d2",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"转型 AI大模型",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":-385,
			"y":-160,
			"width":105,
			"height":60,
			"color":"1"
		},
		{
			"id":"bfb6f89fd6d3e76c",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"健身",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":-800,
			"y":-160,
			"width":100,
			"height":60
		},
		{
			"id":"bf63af8d603943d3",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"软考",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":-382,
			"y":110,
			"width":100,
			"height":60
		},
		{
			"id":"193835536e95a5a4",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"个人官网",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":-385,
			"y":-80,
			"width":105,
			"height":60
		},
		{
			"id":"6d1a28af88f94be5",
			"type":"text",
			"text":" AI 大模型 行业交叉需求还是挺多的\n\n冲一冲！！\n\n- 大模型应用\n- 大模型和嵌入式的结合\n- 大模型在各垂类行业的交叉融合\n",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":135,
			"y":300,
			"width":333,
			"height":220,
			"color":"1"
		},
		{
			"id":"c718fd7d79ec9923",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"编程不应仅被视为产出程序代码的过程，而是程序员构建理论的活动，此理论存在于程序员脑海，是对实际问题的深刻理解。\n\nvia: [通俗翻译：编程即理论构建｜在 LLM 时代成为开发者意味着什么 - 哔哩哔哩](https://www.bilibili.com/opus/1085219763374784517)",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":-487,
			"y":320,
			"width":420,
			"height":180
		},
		{
			"id":"789f77ce76fadf8a",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"- 善用自己的观察力\n- 培养洞察力",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":-453,
			"y":600,
			"width":258,
			"height":100,
			"color":"4"
		},
		{
			"id":"2dded6e547100721",
